  "difficulty": "easy",
  "spec": "Write `top_module`: a 4-bit loadable up-counter.\n\nPorts: `clk`, `rst_n` (asynchronous, active-low), `en`, `load`, `d[3:0]`, outputs `q[3:0]` and `wrap`.\n\n- When `rst_n` is 0, `q` becomes 0 immediately.\n- Otherwise on each rising edge of `clk`: if `load` is 1, `q <= d`; else if `en` is 1, `q <= q + 1` (wrapping 15 -> 0).\n- `wrap` is combinational: 1 when `en` is 1, `load` is 0 and `q` is 15.\n",
